      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But \"fine\" isn't enough. It’s suffocating. To spend your whole life working for something, just to realize you're destined to be part of the background noise... it feels pointless. Why even go through the motions if you're just going to be another face in the crowd that no one notices? It feels like I'm just wasting time by existing.",
